==Battleground==
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6~20 seconds<sup>180f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 0.07~1.33 seconds<sup>2f~40f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Simply rush this stage with [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]]. The enemies aren't even at 100% buff, so they're very easy to beat.

